  title: THE WIDOW'S INHERITANCE
  description: My Pontiff, a noble widow of Lacrimal Hill wishes to leave part of
    her estate to a faith before she dies. Her nephews, who expected all of it, watch
    every priest who climbs her stairs. Her favor could raise us among the great
    houses, or make enemies of them.
